      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We report a case of neonatal generalized erythema and epidermolysis resulting from a novel mutation in the junctional plakoglobin gene causing truncation of the plakoglobin protein. Expedited genetic testing enabled diagnosis while the patient was in the neonatal intensive care unit, providing valuable information for the clinicians and family."
      },
